OL,3,ALammy urges Burnham to take UK back
OL,4,Ainto the EU
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe prime minister has held out the
OL,7,Fpossibility he could ask to rejoin at
OL,8,Fsome stage, whilst ruling out major
OL,9,Fchanges before the next election.
